          <h2>External Resources</h2>
          <ul class="resource-list">
            <li><a href="https://science.nasa.gov/solar-system/dwarf-planets/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NASA Dwarf Planets</a> - Overview of all recognized dwarf planets</li>
